{"title":"Home","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Home","page-layout":"full"},"headingText":"Explore our community hub","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<div class=\"hero\">\n  <span class=\"pill\">📍 Regina</span><span class=\"pill\">Saskatchewan</span><span class=\"pill\">Global Connections</span>\n  <h1>Connecting People. Sharing Knowledge. Building Communities.</h1>\n  <p>Welcome to Prairie Community &amp; Innovation Hub — a growing community initiative connecting residents with education, employment resources, research, practical information, and opportunities to collaborate.</p>\n  <a class=\"cta\" href=\"contact.qmd\">Get in touch →</a>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"intro\">Choose a topic below to explore dedicated resources and opportunities. These cards are fully clickable and open their respective pages.</p>\n\n<div class=\"hub-grid\">\n  <a class=\"hub-card blue\" href=\"community.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">🏠</span><h3>Community Support →</h3><p>Local services, practical resources and community connections.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card mint\" href=\"education.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">🎓</span><h3>Education &amp; Training →</h3><p>Digital skills, learning resources and training opportunities.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card amber\" href=\"jobs.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">💼</span><h3>Jobs &amp; Business →</h3><p>Career resources, job search tools and entrepreneurship.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card lav\" href=\"newcomers.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">🤝</span><h3>Newcomers &amp; Families →</h3><p>Settlement, family life and navigating Saskatchewan.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card teal\" href=\"immigration.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">🌍</span><h3>Immigration &amp; Permits →</h3><p>Official resources for study, work, visitor visas and permanent residence.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card rose\" href=\"health.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">❤️</span><h3>Health Awareness →</h3><p>Evidence-based health information and public resources.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card blue\" href=\"research.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">📊</span><h3>Research &amp; Data →</h3><p>Community insights, reports and interactive dashboards.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card mint\" href=\"events.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">📅</span><h3>Events &amp; Volunteering →</h3><p>Community activities, participation and opportunities to contribute.</p></a>\n</div>\n\n## Have a question or an idea?\n\nWe welcome community feedback, collaboration ideas and general inquiries. [Send an inquiry →](contact.qmd)\n\n<div class=\"note\">This website is being developed. Resources link to independent third-party and official providers; listing a resource does not imply a partnership or endorsement.</div>\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<div class=\"hero\">\n  <span class=\"pill\">📍 Regina</span><span class=\"pill\">Saskatchewan</span><span class=\"pill\">Global Connections</span>\n  <h1>Connecting People. Sharing Knowledge. Building Communities.</h1>\n  <p>Welcome to Prairie Community &amp; Innovation Hub — a growing community initiative connecting residents with education, employment resources, research, practical information, and opportunities to collaborate.</p>\n  <a class=\"cta\" href=\"contact.qmd\">Get in touch →</a>\n</div>\n\n## Explore our community hub\n\n<p class=\"intro\">Choose a topic below to explore dedicated resources and opportunities. These cards are fully clickable and open their respective pages.</p>\n\n<div class=\"hub-grid\">\n  <a class=\"hub-card blue\" href=\"community.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">🏠</span><h3>Community Support →</h3><p>Local services, practical resources and community connections.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card mint\" href=\"education.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">🎓</span><h3>Education &amp; Training →</h3><p>Digital skills, learning resources and training opportunities.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card amber\" href=\"jobs.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">💼</span><h3>Jobs &amp; Business →</h3><p>Career resources, job search tools and entrepreneurship.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card lav\" href=\"newcomers.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">🤝</span><h3>Newcomers &amp; Families →</h3><p>Settlement, family life and navigating Saskatchewan.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card teal\" href=\"immigration.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">🌍</span><h3>Immigration &amp; Permits →</h3><p>Official resources for study, work, visitor visas and permanent residence.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card rose\" href=\"health.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">❤️</span><h3>Health Awareness →</h3><p>Evidence-based health information and public resources.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card blue\" href=\"research.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">📊</span><h3>Research &amp; Data →</h3><p>Community insights, reports and interactive dashboards.</p></a>\n  <a class=\"hub-card mint\" href=\"events.qmd\"><span class=\"symbol\">📅</span><h3>Events &amp; Volunteering →</h3><p>Community activities, participation and opportunities to contribute.</p></a>\n</div>\n\n## Have a question or an idea?\n\nWe welcome community feedback, collaboration ideas and general inquiries. [Send an inquiry →](contact.qmd)\n\n<div class=\"note\">This website is being developed. Resources link to independent third-party and official providers; listing a resource does not imply a partnership or endorsement.</div>\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig